    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prūrĭōsus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		prurio. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>That causes itching</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bulbus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Tard. 2, 1, 33</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Excited by desire</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puella,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Priap.
					63, 18</span></i>
			.</div>
